<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Covers the static/marketing routes only. Movie and event detail pages
  (/movies/:id, /events/:id) are intentionally NOT listed here — they're
  created/deleted dynamically through the admin panel, so a static file
  can't stay accurate; generating those entries needs a small build- or
  request-time script that reads the current catalog from the API, which
  is real, scoped follow-up work rather than something to fake here with
  a stale list of IDs.

  TODO (post-deploy, one-time): every https://your-domain.example below
  is a placeholder — find-and-replace it with this app's real Vercel
  production URL (see DEPLOYMENT.md) once you have it, then redeploy.
  Until that's done, `robots.txt`'s `Sitemap:` line points a crawler at
  a file that doesn't describe this deployment yet.
-->
